# What the Python scripts in this directory import beyond the standard
# library, exact pins, compiled into the hash lock scripts/requirements.txt
# next to this file. Regenerate that lock with the command in its own header,
# never by hand. Renovate's pip-compile manager bumps a pin here and replays
# the same command.
#
# integration-tests.yml installs it before seeding the stack, because
# seed_all runs scripts/permissions.py with the system Python rather than
# tests/.venv. Keep pyyaml equal to the pins in tests/requirements.txt and
# tests/unit/requirements.in.
pyyaml==6.0.3
